                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The purpose of this dataset is to identify and categorize the determinants of welfare non-take-up based on a review of existing literature. The study conducted a scoping review of 80 studies published in the last decade from developed countries, aiming to create a theoretical framework for understanding welfare non-take-up and guiding policy and future research."
                },
